(** Selected predecessor of an actual positive DTW cell. advance_a changes the first coordinate,
    advance_b the second. Finite ties prefer diagonal, then advance_a, then advance_b.
    Unrepresentable accumulated costs have no finite predecessor witness; successful traceback
    never uses them.

    {b Example:}

    {@cpp[
    const auto t=dm::geometry::dynamic_time_warping_trace({1},{1});
    std::print("{}\n",t.predecessors[0]==dm::geometry::DTWPredecessor::origin); // true
