      C++: [Splom & datamunge::Splom::color(datamunge::graphics::RGB value)]

      @param value Point color (default [{37, 99, 235}]).
      @return This matrix, for chaining.
      @see "set_col(datamunge::graphics::RGB)" C++ [set_col(datamunge::graphics::RGB)] *)
  val color : [> `Splom ] obj -> [> `RGB ] obj -> splom

