    \[x, x+width) x \[y, y+height) of [src]. Throws std::out_of_range if the requested rectangle isn't fully contained in [src].

    C++: [Image datamunge::image::crop(const Image & src, int x, int y, int width, int height)]

    @param src the C++ argument [src]
    @param x the C++ argument [x]
    @param y the C++ argument [y]
