    {- C++ normal_distribution specification: https://eel.is/c++draft/rand.dist.norm.normal .}}

    C++:
    [std::vector<Point2D> datamunge::geometry::sample_gaussian_points(std::size_t count = 40, std::uint32_t seed = 20240728, std::size_t max_points = 1000000)]

    @param count Number of points, default forty. (optional; C++ default [40])
    @param seed Local mt19937 seed, default 20240728. (optional; C++ default [20240728])
