    the result; borrows finite inputs without mutation. No band, slope bound, step weighting,
    length normalization or fitted parameters. Finite ties choose diagonal, then advance_a, then
    advance_b. O(n{i m) recurrence time, O(n}m+n+m) scratch/output, with only two double cost
    rows and n*m predecessor bytes. Complete input/geometry validation precedes allocation.
