    Nonnegative fractional counts are accepted algebraically but do not automatically define a
    sampling model. O(k) work/storage, inputs unchanged, no shared state or omission.

    {b Example:}

    {@cpp[
    const auto q=dm::stats::chi_squared_goodness_of_fit({10,10});
    std::print("{:.0f}\n",q.statistic); // 0
    ]}

